WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,470
I wasn't the one who put out the fire yesterday

2
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:04,470
It was Wang Kexin who concealed Xue Ya's intention and destroyed it.

3
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:05,870
Xue Ya asked me to take the blame

4
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,670
I've sent messages for her before

5
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:09,230
But starting from today there is no more

6
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,760
Xu Wei you

7
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,240
I took the blame once for you

8
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,640
I won’t recite it a second time

9
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,340
Where is she?

10
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,060
Always with Zhang Feifei

11
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,580
He's a white-eyed wolf

12
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,140
Many people are asking now

13
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,220
Will you ever change things in order to force others to do so in the future?

14
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,660
Put out the father-in-law's fire again

15
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,630
Then how do we find out about them and find people in the future?

16
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,950
Who is willing now?

17
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:29,990
Su Tang is gone

18
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:31,870
Miao Xiner and the others are just trying to destroy demons

19
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:41,130
They may not be willing to take risks for us. They are strong enough and waterproof enough.

20
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,170
All the kitchen lacks now is design and manpower

21
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,650
Not dealing with a sheep this time

22
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:45,770
There are no twenty people

23
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,330
I have to work until the year of the monkey and the month of the horse.

24
00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:49,890
There is the smell of a lot of small animal activity in the distance.

25
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,410
First list the future wages
